OL,3,GNEWSAHow can heritage buildings be
OL,4,Abrought back into use?
OL,5,
OL,6,FGloucester City Council said the
OL,7,Fbuilding was set to benefit from a
OL,8,F#261,500 grant through the government's
OL,9,FHeritage at Risk Capital Fund.
